        difficulty: "basic",
        turns: [
          { speaker: "you", textEn: "I just got a new prescription. I'd like to buy a pair of glasses. What do you have in my price range?", textZh: "我刚拿到新处方。想配一副眼镜。在我的预算范围内有什么选择？" },
          { speaker: "them", role: "配镜师", textEn: "Let me see your prescription. We have frames starting from $80. With lenses, a basic pair runs about $150-250. Do you have any preference for frame style?", textZh: "让我看看你的处方。镜框80美元起。加上镜片，基本款大约150-250美元。你对镜框款式有偏好吗？", keyPhrases: [{ en: "frames", zh: "镜框" }, { en: "lenses", zh: "镜片" }],
            alternativeExpressions: [
              { textEn: "Can I see your prescription? Our frames start at $80, and a complete pair with lenses is about 150 to 250. Any particular style you're looking for?", textZh: "能看看你的处方吗？我们镜框80美元起，含镜片的整副大约150到250。有什么特别想要的款式吗？", actionHint: "查看处方并介绍价位", frequency: "common" },
              { textEn: "Let me take a look at your script. We've got a good range of frames from $80 up. With lenses, you're looking at $150 to $250 for a basic pair. What style do you like?", textZh: "让我看看你的处方。我们有很多镜框，80美元起。加上镜片，基本款150到250美元。你喜欢什么风格？", actionHint: "介绍产品范围和价格", frequency: "common" },
            ],
          },
          { speaker: "you", textEn: "I prefer lightweight frames. Something comfortable for everyday use.", textZh: "我喜欢轻便的镜框。适合日常佩戴的。" },
          { speaker: "them", role: "配镜师", textEn: "Try these titanium frames — they're very light and durable. I'd also recommend anti-reflective coating and UV protection for the lenses.", textZh: "试试这副钛合金镜框——很轻又耐用。镜片我建议加防反射涂层和紫外线防护。", keyPhrases: [{ en: "titanium", zh: "钛合金" }, { en: "anti-reflective coating", zh: "防反射涂层" }, { en: "UV protection", zh: "紫外线防护" }],
            alternativeExpressions: [
              { textEn: "These titanium ones are great — super lightweight and really durable. For the lenses, I'd suggest adding anti-glare coating and UV protection.", textZh: "这副钛合金的很不错——超轻又特别耐用。镜片建议加防眩光涂层和紫外线防护。", actionHint: "推荐镜框和镜片升级", frequency: "common" },
              { textEn: "How about these? They're titanium — lightweight, flexible, and last a long time. I'd also throw in anti-reflective and UV coatings for the lenses if I were you.", textZh: "试试这副？钛合金的——轻便、有弹性、用得久。如果是我的话镜片也会加防反射和紫外线涂层。", actionHint: "以个人建议口吻推荐", frequency: "occasional" },
            ],
          },
          { speaker: "you", textEn: "I like these. How much with all the coatings?", textZh: "我喜欢这副。加上所有涂层多少钱？" },
          { speaker: "them", role: "配镜师", textEn: "The frames are $120, standard lenses $80, and the anti-reflective plus UV coating is $50. Total comes to $250.", textZh: "镜框120美元，标准镜片80美元，防反射加紫外线涂层50美元。总共250美元。",
            alternativeExpressions: [
              { textEn: "So that's 120 for the frame, 80 for standard lenses, plus 50 for the coatings. Comes out to 250 all in.", textZh: "镜框120，标准镜片80，涂层50。总共250。", actionHint: "逐项报价并算总额", frequency: "common" },
              { textEn: "Let me break it down: frames are 120, lenses 80, and the anti-reflective plus UV package is 50. That brings your total to $250.", textZh: "我给你分项算一下：镜框120，镜片80，防反射加紫外线套餐50。你的总价是250美元。", actionHint: "清晰分项列出价格", frequency: "common" },
            ],
          },
          { speaker: "you", textEn: "How long will it take to have them ready?", textZh: "多久能取？" },
          { speaker: "them", role: "配镜师", textEn: "With your prescription, about 3 to 5 business days. We can also do express service for an extra $30 — ready in 24 hours.", textZh: "根据你的度数，大约3到5个工作日。也可以加30美元选择加急服务——24小时内完成。", keyPhrases: [{ en: "business days", zh: "工作日" }, { en: "express service", zh: "加急服务" }],
            alternativeExpressions: [
              { textEn: "Normally 3 to 5 business days for your prescription. But if you need them sooner, we offer rush service — $30 extra and they're done in 24 hours.", textZh: "你的度数正常要3到5个工作日。但如果急用，我们有加急服务——加30美元，24小时内完成。", actionHint: "说明制作时间和加急选项", frequency: "common" },
              { textEn: "For your prescription, it takes about 3 to 5 days. In a hurry? For an additional $30, we can have them ready by tomorrow.", textZh: "你的度数大约需要3到5天。着急的话加30美元，明天就能取。", actionHint: "提供加急选择", frequency: "common" },
            ],
          },
          { speaker: "you", textEn: "I'll take the express option. I'm leaving the country soon.", textZh: "我选加急。我马上要出国了。" },
          { speaker: "them", role: "配镜师", textEn: "No problem. Let me adjust the fit. I'll measure your pupillary distance and adjust the nose pads. We'll call you when they're ready.", textZh: "没问题。让我调整一下佩戴。我来量一下你的瞳距并调整鼻托。做好了我们会打电话通知你。", keyPhrases: [{ en: "pupillary distance", zh: "瞳距" }, { en: "nose pads", zh: "鼻托" }],
            alternativeExpressions: [
              { textEn: "Great choice. Let me get your PD measurement and set the nose pads for you. We'll give you a call as soon as they're ready.", textZh: "选得好。让我测一下瞳距并给你调好鼻托。做好了就给你打电话。", actionHint: "确认订单并测量", frequency: "common" },
              { textEn: "Perfect. I need to measure the distance between your pupils for the lenses and tweak the nose pads. We'll call or text when they're done.", textZh: "好的。我需要为镜片测量你的瞳距，再调整一下鼻托。做好了打电话或发短信通知你。", actionHint: "解释测量原因", frequency: "common" },
            ],
          },
        ],
